(983330, 116768, 20779, '<td valign="top">Great photo., with crisp, clean lines and tonal range.  I love the different look for this challenge.  Very well done image and perfect for the challenge! Excellent work!</td>', 'Great photo., with crisp, clean lines and tonal range.  I love the different look for this challenge.  Very well done image and perfect for the challenge! Excellent work!', '2004-11-01 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(983340, 116931, 17033, '<td valign="top">Clever idea but problems with execution. I guess you must have had to dim lights to allow for long exposure and that probably led to focus and grain problems. Good attempt though.</td>', 'Clever idea but problems with execution. I guess you must have had to dim lights to allow for long exposure and that probably led to focus and grain problems. Good attempt though.', '2004-11-01 13:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(983346, 116761, 17033, '<td valign="top">Great! Very nice post-processing with mix of sharp and soft. Love the brown tint and most of all love the light on the eye which really grabs the viewer.</td>', 'Great! Very nice post-processing with mix of sharp and soft. Love the brown tint and most of all love the light on the eye which really grabs the viewer.', '2004-11-01 13:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(983353, 116069, 17033, '<td valign="top">Tighter crop needed here to remove non-essential distractions. I would also have liked grainier b/w. Well done though</td>', 'Tighter crop needed here to remove non-essential distractions. I would also have liked grainier b/w. Well done though', '2004-11-01 13:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(983364, 116452, 17033, '<td valign="top">Processing has given it a computer generated feel which is either too much or not enough. To give it more of a ''poster art'' feel I think you need to remove the distractions in the background (e.g central black square blob and stylus arm rest) to keep it to just the bare essentials</td>', 'Processing has given it a computer generated feel which is either too much or not enough. To give it more of a ''poster art'' feel I think you need to remove the distractions in the background (e.g central black square blob and stylus arm rest) to keep it to just the bare essentials', '2004-11-01 13:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(983368, 117026, 17033, '<td valign="top">Well-captured. Nice visual trick. Higher cropping to remove steps and grey box might have added.</td>', 'Well-captured. Nice visual trick. Higher cropping to remove steps and grey box might have added.', '2004-11-01 13:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(983373, 116867, 17033, '<td valign="top">Focus a bit off and would have cropped around waist and tighter on interesting arrangement of heads/shirts/drones.</td>', 'Focus a bit off and would have cropped around waist and tighter on interesting arrangement of heads/shirts/drones.', '2004-11-01 13:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(983374, 115693, 17033, '<td valign="top">Not sure fir trees are the right counterpoint to the trumpet and think you''ve cropped to tight in the upper right</td>', 'Not sure fir trees are the right counterpoint to the trumpet and think you''ve cropped to tight in the upper right', '2004-11-01 13:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(983376, 116839, 17033, '<td valign="top">murky grey skin/sticks not very nice.</td>', 'murky grey skin/sticks not very nice.', '2004-11-01 13:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(983384, 116127, 17033, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this is going to be attacked from all sides! A few suggestions:<br/>1) subject matter of CDs has been done a lot and this doesn''t make me stop and think ''hey, great take on the subject''<br/>2) focus is badly off<br/>3) use image editing software to bring image to as near maximum allowed size as possible<br/>4) lighting and background are not very good<br/> <br/>Keep trying, good results with low-spec cameras are definitely possible so don''t lose heart<br/></td>', 'I''m afraid this is going to be attacked from all sides! A few suggestions:1) subject matter of CDs has been done a lot and this doesn''t make me stop and think ''hey, great take on the subject''2) focus is badly off3) use image editing software to bring image to as near maximum allowed size as possible4) lighting and background are not very good Keep trying, good results with low-spec cameras are definitely possible so don''t lose heart', '2004-11-01 13:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(983393, 116829, 17033, '<td valign="top">Suggestions:<br/>1) could have used something more eye-catching/attractive than a dirty sock!! e.g. apple.<br/>2) lighting doesn''t highlight oboe/clarinet and background to dark<br/>3) focus off<br/>4) composition: think about the position and importance of the objects....this isn''t the sock challenge!<br/> <br/>better luck next time</td>', 'Suggestions:1) could have used something more eye-catching/attractive than a dirty sock!! e.g. apple.2) lighting doesn''t highlight oboe/clarinet and background to dark3) focus off4) composition: think about the position and importance of the objects....this isn''t the sock challenge! better luck next time', '2004-11-01 13:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
