(983544, 116127, 2337, '<td valign="top">This image had a lot of potential, but suffered from file size and dimension.  You''re allowed 640 pixels on one edge and 150k bytes... You should really try to use them all as it makes a huge difference in what the voters see :)</td>', 'This image had a lot of potential, but suffered from file size and dimension.  You''re allowed 640 pixels on one edge and 150k bytes... You should really try to use them all as it makes a huge difference in what the voters see :)', '2004-11-01 15:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
