(983570, 116440, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and concept.  I would have liked not quite as centered of an arrangement and a tad bit sharper focus.</td>', 'Very nice composition and concept.  I would have liked not quite as centered of an arrangement and a tad bit sharper focus.', '2004-11-01 15:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
