(983577, 116717, 20779, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and focus; for me, this is more of a snapshot with a bit too much noise for me to score very high, however.</td>', 'Nice colors and focus; for me, this is more of a snapshot with a bit too much noise for me to score very high, however.', '2004-11-01 15:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(983579, 116690, 20779, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and just slight surreal effect of this take. Very nice.</td>', 'Love the colors and just slight surreal effect of this take. Very nice.', '2004-11-01 15:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(983580, 115975, 20779, '<td valign="top">Great perspective used. The hand is in perfect focus. The only thing that really husrts it is the blown verticals of the horn and just a bit too shallow DOF for me on the keys.</td>', 'Great perspective used. The hand is in perfect focus. The only thing that really husrts it is the blown verticals of the horn and just a bit too shallow DOF for me on the keys.', '2004-11-01 15:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(983582, 117144, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very emotive and beautiful photograph of the artist. Terrific tonal range.</td>', 'Very emotive and beautiful photograph of the artist. Terrific tonal range.', '2004-11-01 15:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(983589, 116845, 17103, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!</td>', 'Fantastic!', '2004-11-01 15:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(983593, 116091, 28820, '<td valign="top">I think you could have had a lot more implied motion in the model to sell this idea better.</td>', 'I think you could have had a lot more implied motion in the model to sell this idea better.', '2004-11-01 15:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(983901, 117117, 2337, '<td valign="top">Stunning!!  A solid 10!</td>', 'Stunning!!  A solid 10!', '2004-11-01 17:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(984025, 116768, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice clean shot and good choice for black and white though his facial tones suffer from the proximity to that dazzling white shirt. They look kind of in the shadow. His expression doesn''t convey the joys of performing which is the one thing I think would lift this shot into a truly superb one.</td>', 'Nice clean shot and good choice for black and white though his facial tones suffer from the proximity to that dazzling white shirt. They look kind of in the shadow. His expression doesn''t convey the joys of performing which is the one thing I think would lift this shot into a truly superb one.', '2004-11-01 18:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(984050, 116204, 20779, '<td valign="top">Not being a musician, I may be not "getting" it completely. However, the large blown out area and amount not in focus hurts this a lot for me.  I like the composition within the frame and regret not being able to see it more clearly.</td>', 'Not being a musician, I may be not "getting" it completely. However, the large blown out area and amount not in focus hurts this a lot for me.  I like the composition within the frame and regret not being able to see it more clearly.', '2004-11-01 18:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(984058, 116931, 20779, '<td valign="top">Great concept and not easy to do, I am sure. To take this one step above, I would love having the whlte keys not so "on top" and apparent, and a bit more  focus and contrast in the rest of image. But overall, a great job!</td>', 'Great concept and not easy to do, I am sure. To take this one step above, I would love having the whlte keys not so "on top" and apparent, and a bit more  focus and contrast in the rest of image. But overall, a great job!', '2004-11-01 18:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(984070, 117172, 20779, '<td valign="top">This is a start of a very interesting image, but the arm/white tee-shirt really destroys it for me.  If I am just not "getting it", my apology.</td>', 'This is a start of a very interesting image, but the arm/white tee-shirt really destroys it for me.  If I am just not "getting it", my apology.', '2004-11-01 18:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(984076, 116918, 20779, '<td valign="top">The guitar is just beautiful and the whole image extremely well done, but the background makes it a bit busy or cluttered in a way, also.  Still receives a high score from me.</td>', 'The guitar is just beautiful and the whole image extremely well done, but the background makes it a bit busy or cluttered in a way, also.  Still receives a high score from me.', '2004-11-01 18:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(984079, 116718, 20779, '<td valign="top">This could have looked really "cheap", but you did something very, very right and made a really crisp, riveting image. Congrats!</td>', 'This could have looked really "cheap", but you did something very, very right and made a really crisp, riveting image. Congrats!', '2004-11-01 18:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(984087, 115965, 20779, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and persepctive; needs a little sharper focus and more interesting background to really make it stand out IMHO.</td>', 'Nice composition and persepctive; needs a little sharper focus and more interesting background to really make it stand out IMHO.', '2004-11-01 18:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(984091, 116841, 20779, '<td valign="top">I got a great laugh out of this - good job! I wish the white feathers at the throat weren''t "blown out". The rest of the bird is just awesome.  The cage/wire in the background is just a tiny bit distracting in that the focus goes in and out - but I know you had to work around that as it is.</td>', 'I got a great laugh out of this - good job! I wish the white feathers at the throat weren''t "blown out". The rest of the bird is just awesome.  The cage/wire in the background is just a tiny bit distracting in that the focus goes in and out - but I know you had to work around that as it is.', '2004-11-01 18:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(984238, 117090, 20779, '<td valign="top">This looks like the technique used for the juggling photo - very well done!! The color tones and range are appearing somewhat off on my PC, and the gfirl''s face a tad over-exposed, but small issues for a superb image.</td>', 'This looks like the technique used for the juggling photo - very well done!! The color tones and range are appearing somewhat off on my PC, and the gfirl''s face a tad over-exposed, but small issues for a superb image.', '2004-11-01 19:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(984242, 117077, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect and concept; I am not sure that the one key being in focus actually "works" for  me however. The image is a bit unsettling or over-worked for me to completely enjoy.</td>', 'Very nice effect and concept; I am not sure that the one key being in focus actually "works" for  me however. The image is a bit unsettling or over-worked for me to completely enjoy.', '2004-11-01 19:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(984247, 116325, 20779, '<td valign="top">What clean, clear, crisp and vivid colors and contrast. Cute title, too. Absolute 10.</td>', 'What clean, clear, crisp and vivid colors and contrast. Cute title, too. Absolute 10.', '2004-11-01 19:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(984254, 116799, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very good concert photo.  I don''t especially like the blue tone; I have no idea if that was the lighting or added later., so in no way affects my score. The energy of the shot is a bit flat or undynamic for me, but just an opinion.</td>', 'Very good concert photo.  I don''t especially like the blue tone; I have no idea if that was the lighting or added later., so in no way affects my score. The energy of the shot is a bit flat or undynamic for me, but just an opinion.', '2004-11-01 19:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(984255, 117229, 20779, '<td valign="top">Perfect, sweet 10.</td>', 'Perfect, sweet 10.', '2004-11-01 19:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(984262, 117068, 20779, '<td valign="top">Maybe I am just burning out on B &amp;W, but there isn''t enough tonal contrast for me in this to use B &amp;W. I like the overall shot, though, and think your composition and focus was great.</td>', 'Maybe I am just burning out on B &W, but there isn''t enough tonal contrast for me in this to use B &W. I like the overall shot, though, and think your composition and focus was great.', '2004-11-01 19:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(984313, 117122, 164, '<td valign="top">too blurry</td>', 'too blurry', '2004-11-01 20:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(984348, 116761, 16829, '<td valign="top">A little over processed for my taste, but still a great picture</td>', 'A little over processed for my taste, but still a great picture', '2004-11-01 20:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(984349, 117088, 16829, '<td valign="top">Great lines and color tones; one of my favorites</td>', 'Great lines and color tones; one of my favorites', '2004-11-01 20:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(984353, 116845, 16829, '<td valign="top">Hope you don''t get hammered by the Protectors of Strict Literalism! While I agree that your title should not have to explain the connection to the Challenge, I discount little for that when faced with a fine phorograph. The texture underneath the shadow really sets off a good composition.</td>', 'Hope you don''t get hammered by the Protectors of Strict Literalism! While I agree that your title should not have to explain the connection to the Challenge, I discount little for that when faced with a fine phorograph. The texture underneath the shadow really sets off a good composition.', '2004-11-01 20:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(984367, 115576, 16829, '<td valign="top">Good capture in a darkened space. The composition worked out well, with the sign across the top and enough detail in the background and not too much digital noise or the plasticising effect of removing noise. And oh yeah, girls dancing on a bar :)</td>', 'Good capture in a darkened space. The composition worked out well, with the sign across the top and enough detail in the background and not too much digital noise or the plasticising effect of removing noise. And oh yeah, girls dancing on a bar :)', '2004-11-01 20:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(984427, 116278, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very dynamic picutre. Unfortunatley, the color cast is green throughout the image on my monitor giving it an unappealing presentation.</td>', 'Very dynamic picutre. Unfortunatley, the color cast is green throughout the image on my monitor giving it an unappealing presentation.', '2004-11-01 20:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(984431, 115423, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very cool. For me, the technical "imperfections" are exactly what makes this one work.</td>', 'Very cool. For me, the technical "imperfections" are exactly what makes this one work.', '2004-11-01 20:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(984435, 116069, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice capture. I like the interest highlighted towards the needle and arm. It is a bit on the dark side, and some of the viewers may see too much of the black.</td>', 'Very, very nice capture. I like the interest highlighted towards the needle and arm. It is a bit on the dark side, and some of the viewers may see too much of the black.', '2004-11-01 20:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(984438, 116867, 20779, '<td valign="top">I believe you may see your score suffer somewhat from this being a tad out of focus and appearing to be more of a "snapshot".</td>', 'I believe you may see your score suffer somewhat from this being a tad out of focus and appearing to be more of a "snapshot".', '2004-11-01 20:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(984444, 116452, 20779, '<td valign="top">A little too "digitalized" towards the back for me, adding to the "noise". The front part of the composition is very clean.</td>', 'A little too "digitalized" towards the back for me, adding to the "noise". The front part of the composition is very clean.', '2004-11-01 20:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(984451, 116845, 20779, '<td valign="top">FANTASTIC photo; can''t really see "music".</td>', 'FANTASTIC photo; can''t really see "music".', '2004-11-01 20:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(984458, 116534, 20779, '<td valign="top">Clever and original idea. I don''t really care for the placement of the mike, though. It is too disruptive to the composition for me and out of focus. Maybe if it were chrome or metallic it would look cleaner.</td>', 'Clever and original idea. I don''t really care for the placement of the mike, though. It is too disruptive to the composition for me and out of focus. Maybe if it were chrome or metallic it would look cleaner.', '2004-11-01 20:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(984481, 115576, 20779, '<td valign="top">It appears more like a catwalk than a dance in the image, and the definition and lighting just aren''t enough to raise this above a snapshot for me. I love the setting,  and there is a good energy to the photo.</td>', 'It appears more like a catwalk than a dance in the image, and the definition and lighting just aren''t enough to raise this above a snapshot for me. I love the setting,  and there is a good energy to the photo.', '2004-11-01 21:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(984491, 117309, 20779, '<td valign="top">Love this! My heart just lept when I saw the color and arrangement.</td>', 'Love this! My heart just lept when I saw the color and arrangement.', '2004-11-01 21:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(984496, 117324, 20779, '<td valign="top">Too much of a snapshot to score well I believe.</td>', 'Too much of a snapshot to score well I believe.', '2004-11-01 21:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(984503, 116752, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very near perfect. To just really nit-pik, wish the bottom of the instrument cleared the bottom border.  Superbly classic image.</td>', 'Very near perfect. To just really nit-pik, wish the bottom of the instrument cleared the bottom border.  Superbly classic image.', '2004-11-01 21:06:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(984527, 116178, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very, very well done perspective and clean, sharp lines. The colors and post-processing are a little rough for me.</td>', 'Very, very well done perspective and clean, sharp lines. The colors and post-processing are a little rough for me.', '2004-11-01 21:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(984570, 117287, 15648, '<td valign="top">I love the tie. Nice shot.</td>', 'I love the tie. Nice shot.', '2004-11-01 21:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(984573, 117330, 15648, '<td valign="top">I would have love to seen more of that steel guitar.</td>', 'I would have love to seen more of that steel guitar.', '2004-11-01 21:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(984574, 117314, 15648, '<td valign="top">Different. I like it. 8</td>', 'Different. I like it. 8', '2004-11-01 21:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(984575, 117170, 15648, '<td valign="top">I sure am. 7</td>', 'I sure am. 7', '2004-11-01 21:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(984580, 116322, 15648, '<td valign="top">Living that rock-n-roll life style WILL fade memories. I ought to know.I think you captured it well. Good Job. 7</td>', 'Living that rock-n-roll life style WILL fade memories. I ought to know.I think you captured it well. Good Job. 7', '2004-11-01 21:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(984582, 117225, 15648, '<td valign="top">Nice Macro</td>', 'Nice Macro', '2004-11-01 21:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(984586, 117122, 15648, '<td valign="top">I grew up to the Moody Blues. My moms favorite band. I recongize the album. GREAT ALBUM to boot. PLUS it is vinyl. I was a DJ for 14 yrs. This photo has memories written all over it.</td>', 'I grew up to the Moody Blues. My moms favorite band. I recongize the album. GREAT ALBUM to boot. PLUS it is vinyl. I was a DJ for 14 yrs. This photo has memories written all over it.', '2004-11-01 21:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(984589, 117164, 15648, '<td valign="top">OVATION 12 string? Nice shot</td>', 'OVATION 12 string? Nice shot', '2004-11-01 21:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(984596, 115423, 15648, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. BUT to much contrast. Needs to be toned down. 6</td>', 'Nice shot. BUT to much contrast. Needs to be toned down. 6', '2004-11-01 21:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(984598, 116918, 15648, '<td valign="top">Too much distraction in the background. LOVE the guitar though.</td>', 'Too much distraction in the background. LOVE the guitar though.', '2004-11-01 21:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(984612, 115693, 15648, '<td valign="top">Great idea.</td>', 'Great idea.', '2004-11-01 21:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(984619, 116128, 15648, '<td valign="top">This was my worst nightmare while taking guitar lessons at age 9. Now 30 yrs later, it is my best friend. Nice shot</td>', 'This was my worst nightmare while taking guitar lessons at age 9. Now 30 yrs later, it is my best friend. Nice shot', '2004-11-01 21:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(984625, 115762, 15648, '<td valign="top">Looks more Heavy Metal. Washburn guitar? 7</td>', 'Looks more Heavy Metal. Washburn guitar? 7', '2004-11-01 21:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(984626, 117144, 15648, '<td valign="top">B/W looks good here. Nice shot. 8</td>', 'B/W looks good here. Nice shot. 8', '2004-11-01 21:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(984628, 116457, 15648, '<td valign="top">Love the focus on the bow 8</td>', 'Love the focus on the bow 8', '2004-11-01 21:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(984633, 116845, 15648, '<td valign="top">HA HA. I love it</td>', 'HA HA. I love it', '2004-11-01 21:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(984637, 116350, 15648, '<td valign="top">But it is made in JAPAN&gt; Just kidding.</td>', 'But it is made in JAPAN> Just kidding.', '2004-11-01 21:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(984641, 116347, 15648, '<td valign="top">The colors really give it that rock-a-billy/ blues mood. 8</td>', 'The colors really give it that rock-a-billy/ blues mood. 8', '2004-11-01 21:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(984649, 117294, 15648, '<td valign="top">Love this band. I seen them twice. AWESOME!!!!!  Great shot. If you like concert photo''s. I shoot concert photo''s. I think you will be surprised. If interested, PLEASE check out my webshots webpage:<br/>//community.webshots.com/user/legatomuzic<br/> <br/>P.S. I gave you a 10. GREAT shot. My favorite<br/></td>', 'Love this band. I seen them twice. AWESOME!!!!!  Great shot. If you like concert photo''s. I shoot concert photo''s. I think you will be surprised. If interested, PLEASE check out my webshots webpage://community.webshots.com/user/legatomuzic P.S. I gave you a 10. GREAT shot. My favorite', '2004-11-01 21:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(984858, 117309, 2022, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2004-11-01 23:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(984906, 115825, 18450, '<td valign="top">creative and imaginative.....love the title!</td>', 'creative and imaginative.....love the title!', '2004-11-01 23:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(984915, 115994, 9932, '<td valign="top">Not a big fan of this shot in black &amp; white. But that does not affect my vote, the quality is still very nice.</td>', 'Not a big fan of this shot in black & white. But that does not affect my vote, the quality is still very nice.', '2004-11-01 23:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(984943, 116080, 24128, '<td valign="top">very beautiful pic and subject</td>', 'very beautiful pic and subject', '2004-11-02 00:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(985056, 116067, 17233, '<td valign="top">Love the old-time feel and tonal range :) The lighting also picks up on the important components and gives it form (10)</td>', 'Love the old-time feel and tonal range :) The lighting also picks up on the important components and gives it form (10)', '2004-11-02 01:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(985065, 116178, 9581, '<td valign="top">Nice color and lights in this.</td>', 'Nice color and lights in this.', '2004-11-02 01:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(985085, 116566, 9581, '<td valign="top">Dude! Woah! Thats awesome but wicked!</td>', 'Dude! Woah! Thats awesome but wicked!', '2004-11-02 01:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(985156, 116114, 18897, '<td valign="top">I really like the colours and lightning in this one and the aspect ratio is refreshing. One of my top picks!</td>', 'I really like the colours and lightning in this one and the aspect ratio is refreshing. One of my top picks!', '2004-11-02 03:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(985162, 116193, 18897, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. I think her posture is a bit staged, as if she''s trying to say "get on with it - take the picture already". Some of the yellow tones, especially in the background could be desaturated I think. One of my top picks still - good effort!</td>', 'Very nice composition. I think her posture is a bit staged, as if she''s trying to say "get on with it - take the picture already". Some of the yellow tones, especially in the background could be desaturated I think. One of my top picks still - good effort!', '2004-11-02 03:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(985173, 117026, 18897, '<td valign="top">I like this one, but it bothers me a bit that it''s basically a picture of a picture, although it''s mounted on a train. Not saying it''s not ok by any rules or so, it just brings the last point in the general direction of the original artist..<br/> <br/>Perhaps someone entering or leaving the train would have made the door / scale more obvious?</td>', 'I like this one, but it bothers me a bit that it''s basically a picture of a picture, although it''s mounted on a train. Not saying it''s not ok by any rules or so, it just brings the last point in the general direction of the original artist.. Perhaps someone entering or leaving the train would have made the door / scale more obvious?', '2004-11-02 03:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(985184, 117028, 18897, '<td valign="top">Nice effort and the composition is ok, although I do get the feeling the baton in question seems glued to the paper, the orientation looks forced. The light source seems to be placed to close to the subject washing out colour and detail down to the left. The light areas draws the eye away from the subject a bit and it seems a bit unnatural that it comes from below.</td>', 'Nice effort and the composition is ok, although I do get the feeling the baton in question seems glued to the paper, the orientation looks forced. The light source seems to be placed to close to the subject washing out colour and detail down to the left. The light areas draws the eye away from the subject a bit and it seems a bit unnatural that it comes from below.', '2004-11-02 03:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(985192, 117309, 18897, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, but the arch seems a bit oversaturated - stealing focus from the pipes. This would have fit the "parts" challenge too I guess. 5 from me.</td>', 'Interesting composition, but the arch seems a bit oversaturated - stealing focus from the pipes. This would have fit the "parts" challenge too I guess. 5 from me.', '2004-11-02 03:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(985197, 116091, 18897, '<td valign="top">Ah, how refreshing with a bit of humour. It does however look a bit too staged to be a really good image, but points up for idea and execution.</td>', 'Ah, how refreshing with a bit of humour. It does however look a bit too staged to be a really good image, but points up for idea and execution.', '2004-11-02 03:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(985200, 117133, 18897, '<td valign="top">The notes saves you on this one. I feared we were going to see more discs in this challenge than we actually did, but sanity prevailed overall. Not very interesting though and the centered composition is just a bit too much in my face.</td>', 'The notes saves you on this one. I feared we were going to see more discs in this challenge than we actually did, but sanity prevailed overall. Not very interesting though and the centered composition is just a bit too much in my face.', '2004-11-02 03:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(985226, 116752, 16970, '<td valign="top">Great shot....  I feel the crop is too tight though ;)  (10)</td>', 'Great shot....  I feel the crop is too tight though ;)  (10)', '2004-11-02 04:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(985229, 116803, 24983, '<td valign="top">I think there is a lot of raw energy here, the movement adds to that and the colours work especially having the singer in the whit light, thems the pluses. On the negative side you have what I call a "Presbyterian " photo, you actually have 2 good shots in one. I think my eye is drawn to the drum kit first then to the singer and lastly to the player, hovever in a funny way the composition works,.you could have a good shot of either the singer or the player here. if I was voting =7</td>', 'I think there is a lot of raw energy here, the movement adds to that and the colours work especially having the singer in the whit light, thems the pluses. On the negative side you have what I call a "Presbyterian " photo, you actually have 2 good shots in one. I think my eye is drawn to the drum kit first then to the singer and lastly to the player, hovever in a funny way the composition works,.you could have a good shot of either the singer or the player here. if I was voting =7', '2004-11-02 04:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(985230, 116719, 8643, '<td valign="top">The greatest of all the instruments - nice shot, avoiding those difficult reflections.  I gave up trying after several attempts. . . .</td>', 'The greatest of all the instruments - nice shot, avoiding those difficult reflections.  I gave up trying after several attempts. . . .', '2004-11-02 04:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(985231, 116764, 24983, '<td valign="top">sorry to tell you this shot doesnt work for me,it is out of focus  and has no depth of field also not that interesting if I was to vote it =2 .</td>', 'sorry to tell you this shot doesnt work for me,it is out of focus  and has no depth of field also not that interesting if I was to vote it =2 .', '2004-11-02 04:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(985236, 117133, 8643, '<td valign="top">Neat idea but maybe it would have been better to have flipped and inverted the music so that it could be read?</td>', 'Neat idea but maybe it would have been better to have flipped and inverted the music so that it could be read?', '2004-11-02 04:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(985239, 117090, 24983, '<td valign="top">I thin that you had a good idea, and the basic photo is ok but the dancng leaves are somehow not placed right maybe take out the ones top right and the two on the extreme left. If i voted = 5</td>', 'I thin that you had a good idea, and the basic photo is ok but the dancng leaves are somehow not placed right maybe take out the ones top right and the two on the extreme left. If i voted = 5', '2004-11-02 04:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(985243, 115762, 24983, '<td valign="top">great little shot with good use of the shapes, I think the white light  is a little bright IMO and shading down to a light blue might work better If I voted =7</td>', 'great little shot with good use of the shapes, I think the white light  is a little bright IMO and shading down to a light blue might work better If I voted =7', '2004-11-02 04:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
