(985426, 116204, 27482, '<td valign="top">I don´t want to offend you but IMO this is one of the worst shots in the challenge.  The horrible overexposed light, the flare, the fact that you can´t make out what the instrument is, the lighting is poor and also it is out of focus.  I just want to explain why I am giving it a 1 and please don´t get discouraged as you can easily improve this shot.</td>', 'I don´t want to offend you but IMO this is one of the worst shots in the challenge.  The horrible overexposed light, the flare, the fact that you can´t make out what the instrument is, the lighting is poor and also it is out of focus.  I just want to explain why I am giving it a 1 and please don´t get discouraged as you can easily improve this shot.', '2004-11-02 07:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
