(985609, 117297, 18897, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but the burned out / overexposed lower left side is hurting the image. Also the focus seems off because it''s not on the the most dominant part - the light wood. I think had been better either with that in focus or a deeper DOF. I think I want to see a bit more of it too - less tightly cropped. It''s a 5 from me.</td>', 'Not bad, but the burned out / overexposed lower left side is hurting the image. Also the focus seems off because it''s not on the the most dominant part - the light wood. I think had been better either with that in focus or a deeper DOF. I think I want to see a bit more of it too - less tightly cropped. It''s a 5 from me.', '2004-11-02 10:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(985614, 116691, 18897, '<td valign="top">Actually I think the notes are completely destroying a very well lit guitar. You probably got them in there somehow legaly but it seems like they''re cut out in Photoshop or so. Without the notes a 6, now it''s a 4, sorry.</td>', 'Actually I think the notes are completely destroying a very well lit guitar. You probably got them in there somehow legaly but it seems like they''re cut out in Photoshop or so. Without the notes a 6, now it''s a 4, sorry.', '2004-11-02 10:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(985625, 116764, 18897, '<td valign="top">Took me forever to actually see what it was. Way out of focus makes it look like you took it with your camera-phone. Lots of distracting elements left even if it had been in focus. Either it''s an attempt at the brown ribbon or you need to try a bit harder I think.</td>', 'Took me forever to actually see what it was. Way out of focus makes it look like you took it with your camera-phone. Lots of distracting elements left even if it had been in focus. Either it''s an attempt at the brown ribbon or you need to try a bit harder I think.', '2004-11-02 10:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(985637, 117324, 18897, '<td valign="top">I don''t like this one very much. The point of view makes it look like a snapshot for ebay.com, it''s not in really in focus anywhere, the cropping doesn''t help much and the thing that catches your eye to the left, whatever it is with "rock" in it, is reflecting light in an unfortunate way. A below average attempt I think and voted 3.</td>', 'I don''t like this one very much. The point of view makes it look like a snapshot for ebay.com, it''s not in really in focus anywhere, the cropping doesn''t help much and the thing that catches your eye to the left, whatever it is with "rock" in it, is reflecting light in an unfortunate way. A below average attempt I think and voted 3.', '2004-11-02 10:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(985641, 116829, 18897, '<td valign="top">Not very appealing. All you see is the sock and even though the title does add a bit of humour as you make an effort to see what it actually is, it remains an uninteresting composition. 2.</td>', 'Not very appealing. All you see is the sock and even though the title does add a bit of humour as you make an effort to see what it actually is, it remains an uninteresting composition. 2.', '2004-11-02 10:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
