(985657, 116724, 18897, '<td valign="top">Such lovely colors and light. On topic? I have to stretch my imagination a bit or read your title twice. Would have given you a higher score in another challenge I think, but still a 6.</td>', 'Such lovely colors and light. On topic? I have to stretch my imagination a bit or read your title twice. Would have given you a higher score in another challenge I think, but still a 6.', '2004-11-02 10:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
