(985785, 117172, 11653, '<td valign="top">This just doen''t work for me. Back ground too busy. Maybe show more of the person''s arm/hand. Or shot more from the side of person instead of from back</td>', 'This just doen''t work for me. Back ground too busy. Maybe show more of the person''s arm/hand. Or shot more from the side of person instead of from back', '2004-11-02 11:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
