(986500, 117170, 28742, '<td valign="top">It might be just a little too dark - he could be eating corn-on-the-cob or playing a harmonica.  ;-)</td>', 'It might be just a little too dark - he could be eating corn-on-the-cob or playing a harmonica.  ;-)', '2004-11-02 16:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(986529, 116857, 9747, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this is too... I don''t know, stationary? It needs some dynamic action, such as perhaps making the stick slightly diagonal and maybe a slower shutter speed to give the stick some action blur (or keep the same shutter speed and flick the stick really, really fast). Nice shot, though! Very good DOF and the salt (or whatever the jumping specks are) are a very nice touch!</td>', 'In my opinion, this is too... I don''t know, stationary? It needs some dynamic action, such as perhaps making the stick slightly diagonal and maybe a slower shutter speed to give the stick some action blur (or keep the same shutter speed and flick the stick really, really fast). Nice shot, though! Very good DOF and the salt (or whatever the jumping specks are) are a very nice touch!', '2004-11-02 16:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(986568, 117309, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good composition with those repeating half-circles.</td>', 'Good composition with those repeating half-circles.', '2004-11-02 17:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(986571, 116278, 9747, '<td valign="top">Very cute! Great negative space. I like how you left a lot of the black background in though I think it''s a bit off. Cropping a little of the top and the left might balance things out. Nice capture! Especially catching the humorous expressions (to me, anyway) on a couple of the performers.</td>', 'Very cute! Great negative space. I like how you left a lot of the black background in though I think it''s a bit off. Cropping a little of the top and the left might balance things out. Nice capture! Especially catching the humorous expressions (to me, anyway) on a couple of the performers.', '2004-11-02 17:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(986610, 117117, 9747, '<td valign="top">Perspective needs to be corrected... while the dancers seem to be horizontal, the floor and chairs aren''t vertical, throwing things off. Background could be darker but I suppose that couldn''t be helped. Very, very nice action! I thought it was really cool how you captured the ''ghostly'' images of the dancers in great poses. Kudos!</td>', 'Perspective needs to be corrected... while the dancers seem to be horizontal, the floor and chairs aren''t vertical, throwing things off. Background could be darker but I suppose that couldn''t be helped. Very, very nice action! I thought it was really cool how you captured the ''ghostly'' images of the dancers in great poses. Kudos!', '2004-11-02 17:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
