(994351, 117073, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/>This is an image that I placed at 5 on first glance but can''t seem to move it higher. I see a typical charm in the lettering of uneven size fonts along with the dying nature of these once movie houses. On the other hand once I read the message and look at the name atop the marque my eyes then stufy its pleasant colors. outside of this, I wish this shot was taken much later to give it more life. The photograph is well taken and its quality is not at all in question.</td>', 'returning for comments.This is an image that I placed at 5 on first glance but can''t seem to move it higher. I see a typical charm in the lettering of uneven size fonts along with the dying nature of these once movie houses. On the other hand once I read the message and look at the name atop the marque my eyes then stufy its pleasant colors. outside of this, I wish this shot was taken much later to give it more life. The photograph is well taken and its quality is not at all in question.', '2004-11-05 23:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(994355, 117264, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/>certainly the king of sound. A good representation in a dramatic view. I would have reconsidered the table surface. All in all, you did a good job.</td>', 'returning for comments.certainly the king of sound. A good representation in a dramatic view. I would have reconsidered the table surface. All in all, you did a good job.', '2004-11-05 23:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
