(994418, 117058, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/>A very risky shot for this effect because the exposed whites gobble up thew image and leave only the black to capture. One way to improve this is to close the lens all the way to get the longest exposure and then to hold the hand for about 9/10th of the time and then remove them. Bumping from 4 to 5 for effort.</td>', 'returning for comments.A very risky shot for this effect because the exposed whites gobble up thew image and leave only the black to capture. One way to improve this is to close the lens all the way to get the longest exposure and then to hold the hand for about 9/10th of the time and then remove them. Bumping from 4 to 5 for effort.', '2004-11-05 23:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(994444, 116091, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/>A reproduction of an old commercial image.  This image would have been improved slightly with less overhead and less foreground to give it a panoramic feel. Alsom the hands show good tension but it would have helped if the the head were thrown back just a little. Outside of this you have succeeded in creating a satisfactory and interesting image to look at. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments.A reproduction of an old commercial image.  This image would have been improved slightly with less overhead and less foreground to give it a panoramic feel. Alsom the hands show good tension but it would have helped if the the head were thrown back just a little. Outside of this you have succeeded in creating a satisfactory and interesting image to look at. Bumping up.', '2004-11-05 23:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
