(995173, 116857, 22975, '<td valign="top">the horizontal positioning of the drumstick (which i do believe is proper for drumming) makes this image look sort of static, like the stick is at rest and not in motion.  a slight angle could have brough more movement in.    i also would think that cropping out some more of the drum itself would have drawn more attention to ste stick and splash.  as it is, your eye just kind of drifts toward the white.  the focus is really good, and i like that you chose a natural background (instead of a black sheet, for instance).  makes me think this drummer''s marching on the football field.  :)  oh, and the point of view is nice, here, too.</td>', 'the horizontal positioning of the drumstick (which i do believe is proper for drumming) makes this image look sort of static, like the stick is at rest and not in motion.  a slight angle could have brough more movement in.    i also would think that cropping out some more of the drum itself would have drawn more attention to ste stick and splash.  as it is, your eye just kind of drifts toward the white.  the focus is really good, and i like that you chose a natural background (instead of a black sheet, for instance).  makes me think this drummer''s marching on the football field.  :)  oh, and the point of view is nice, here, too.', '2004-11-06 12:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(995178, 117330, 22975, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting collection, but in my opinon, there is just too much going on, too many lines going in every which direction.  The slant on the wooden instrument on the right side of the pic makes it look a little sloppy.  I like your effort, though, and your take on the challenge.  It was really more interesting than a lot of the shots in this challenge.  :)</td>', 'This is an interesting collection, but in my opinon, there is just too much going on, too many lines going in every which direction.  The slant on the wooden instrument on the right side of the pic makes it look a little sloppy.  I like your effort, though, and your take on the challenge.  It was really more interesting than a lot of the shots in this challenge.  :)', '2004-11-06 12:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
