(995219, 115994, 22975, '<td valign="top">This is one of those instances that the title doesn''t work with the photo.  In my opinion, Karaoke is best done by people who aren''t very musically inclined, and this woman could easily be a sultry nightclub singer, and I think it would have added depth to the photo.  I know it sounds stupid, but that''s just how I see it.  I didn''t mark it down for that, but I think another title would have added more musical credibility to this really nice shot!  7</td>', 'This is one of those instances that the title doesn''t work with the photo.  In my opinion, Karaoke is best done by people who aren''t very musically inclined, and this woman could easily be a sultry nightclub singer, and I think it would have added depth to the photo.  I know it sounds stupid, but that''s just how I see it.  I didn''t mark it down for that, but I think another title would have added more musical credibility to this really nice shot!  7', '2004-11-06 12:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
