(995238, 117229, 5286, '<td valign="top">excellent lighting and composition.</td>', 'excellent lighting and composition.', '2004-11-06 13:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(995251, 116350, 5286, '<td valign="top">the lighting is great. but the composition is not very pleasing. after a lot of thinking, i think it might be due to the presence of a large number of lines which are not unified (the fender line, the stratocaster line, the line of the strings, and the line of the knobs, they all go different places). also the border has the clean straight white lines which further emphasize the other lines.. maybe it would be better with a plain border. also the knob bang in the upper center of the picture is not pleasing, changing the angle from which the picture was taken might have helped the composition.</td>', 'the lighting is great. but the composition is not very pleasing. after a lot of thinking, i think it might be due to the presence of a large number of lines which are not unified (the fender line, the stratocaster line, the line of the strings, and the line of the knobs, they all go different places). also the border has the clean straight white lines which further emphasize the other lines.. maybe it would be better with a plain border. also the knob bang in the upper center of the picture is not pleasing, changing the angle from which the picture was taken might have helped the composition.', '2004-11-06 13:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(995253, 117309, 5286, '<td valign="top">pleasantly composed, which is not easy for such subjects.</td>', 'pleasantly composed, which is not easy for such subjects.', '2004-11-06 13:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
