(996146, 115825, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>I do not appreciate dolls, however, there is something cute about this image. If you changed the bulb, say a very low watt  instead, it would then register within the desired zone. Another possibility is to move the set up over to the left and avoid the lamp altogether. The flooring looks great and so does the lighting on the main subject. Bumping up for great effort.</td>', 'returning for comments:I do not appreciate dolls, however, there is something cute about this image. If you changed the bulb, say a very low watt  instead, it would then register within the desired zone. Another possibility is to move the set up over to the left and avoid the lamp altogether. The flooring looks great and so does the lighting on the main subject. Bumping up for great effort.', '2004-11-07 00:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(996151, 117173, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>A very clever understatement and very well composed. i would have taken the extra pain to have presented a sharper and more color balanced main subject. Bumping up on artistic merit.</td>', 'returning for comments:A very clever understatement and very well composed. i would have taken the extra pain to have presented a sharper and more color balanced main subject. Bumping up on artistic merit.', '2004-11-07 00:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
