(996816, 117090, 27847, '<td valign="top">WOW... and a WOW ... Amazing, great shot. OK... I had to add to the comment. Everytime I look at this I like it more and more and keep bumping the score up... ;-) Oh, one more WOW...</td>', 'WOW... and a WOW ... Amazing, great shot. OK... I had to add to the comment. Everytime I look at this I like it more and more and keep bumping the score up... ;-) Oh, one more WOW...', '2004-11-07 12:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
