(996904, 116862, 2337, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''re getting comments about the guitar and guy being out of focus and the yellowish white balance, and I''m sure some of those comments say it''s a bad thing... Rest assured, someone got it... Nice work :)  My nitpick however is the bright flash in the top left corner and the (something) on the floor in the lower right.  Don''t see them helping... Nice shot all the same :)</td>', 'I''m sure you''re getting comments about the guitar and guy being out of focus and the yellowish white balance, and I''m sure some of those comments say it''s a bad thing... Rest assured, someone got it... Nice work :)  My nitpick however is the bright flash in the top left corner and the (something) on the floor in the lower right.  Don''t see them helping... Nice shot all the same :)', '2004-11-07 14:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(996907, 117077, 2337, '<td valign="top">Interesting variation on a classic shot... I think I like it :) Yep, I like it...</td>', 'Interesting variation on a classic shot... I think I like it :) Yep, I like it...', '2004-11-07 14:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
