(997023, 116457, 7504, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of focus, I''m not sure if it''s what I would have chosen, but it is effective.</td>', 'Interesting choice of focus, I''m not sure if it''s what I would have chosen, but it is effective.', '2004-11-07 15:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
