(997036, 116589, 7504, '<td valign="top">The high key here works very well.  Lovely expression and tones, I might''ve cropped a bit more from the top, and left the ends of her fingers in, but that''s just me.  : )</td>', 'The high key here works very well.  Lovely expression and tones, I might''ve cropped a bit more from the top, and left the ends of her fingers in, but that''s just me.  : )', '2004-11-07 15:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(997042, 116473, 7504, '<td valign="top">Cool, I enjoy the sound of the bowed psaltery.  Nice work.  I think the autumn leaves set it off nicely, I might''ve given it a bit more saturation to bring a richer tone to it.</td>', 'Cool, I enjoy the sound of the bowed psaltery.  Nice work.  I think the autumn leaves set it off nicely, I might''ve given it a bit more saturation to bring a richer tone to it.', '2004-11-07 15:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
