(997256, 116589, 93, '<td valign="top">my favorite of the challenge, and only 10.  Such a great capture, wonderfully lit, and I *love* the upper negative space.  The composition is a classic use of triangle, and almost leads me in an X from the bottom of the violin through to the face, down the arm to the hand, and right back up the bow.  <br/> <br/>It also helps that the girl has such a .. haunting.. look.</td>', 'my favorite of the challenge, and only 10.  Such a great capture, wonderfully lit, and I *love* the upper negative space.  The composition is a classic use of triangle, and almost leads me in an X from the bottom of the violin through to the face, down the arm to the hand, and right back up the bow.   It also helps that the girl has such a .. haunting.. look.', '2004-11-07 17:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(997260, 116091, 93, '<td valign="top">A now classic pose, but a great capture of your version of it.</td>', 'A now classic pose, but a great capture of your version of it.', '2004-11-07 17:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
