(997319, 116091, 15811, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  It''s really professional looking, good lighting and it gets the point across well.  Good job!</td>', 'I like this photo.  It''s really professional looking, good lighting and it gets the point across well.  Good job!', '2004-11-07 18:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(997326, 116764, 15811, '<td valign="top">hrmm not sure what to make of this.  The title is definately music-related, but I really can''t make out what this is at all -- I''m probably just stupid I don''t know.</td>', 'hrmm not sure what to make of this.  The title is definately music-related, but I really can''t make out what this is at all -- I''m probably just stupid I don''t know.', '2004-11-07 18:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(997333, 117077, 15811, '<td valign="top">I really like the photo a lot.  I don''t know much about pianos, but being that the aperture was so large and ONLY the one key is in focus, it might do the picture more justice if it were titled "b flat" or "f sharp" or whatever key that is.<br/> <br/>That''s just something I thought that could add more to your photo -- it doesn''t take anything away, it''s still a beautiful photo.</td>', 'I really like the photo a lot.  I don''t know much about pianos, but being that the aperture was so large and ONLY the one key is in focus, it might do the picture more justice if it were titled "b flat" or "f sharp" or whatever key that is. That''s just something I thought that could add more to your photo -- it doesn''t take anything away, it''s still a beautiful photo.', '2004-11-07 18:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
