(998021, 116717, 22975, '<td valign="top">Some comments, mainly relating to the statement TabbyCat made.  This photo WAS taken at an unusual angle, but unfortunately, I don''t think many people are familiar enough with the iPod NOR did I make it obvious enough in my photo.  The back of the iPod is a mirror, and I placed a cool gift bag opposite the mirror so that the iPod logo stood out more.  I think most people just thought it was a picture of a print out of the iPod logo on a neat background or something.  Oh, well.  I tried.</td>', 'Some comments, mainly relating to the statement TabbyCat made.  This photo WAS taken at an unusual angle, but unfortunately, I don''t think many people are familiar enough with the iPod NOR did I make it obvious enough in my photo.  The back of the iPod is a mirror, and I placed a cool gift bag opposite the mirror so that the iPod logo stood out more.  I think most people just thought it was a picture of a print out of the iPod logo on a neat background or something.  Oh, well.  I tried.', '2004-11-08 00:17:26.000000', NULL, 0),
