(1000517, 115836, 24951, '<td valign="top">Sorry you didn''t do better - you got jipped in my opinion. I gave it a 10. Found -not only for THIS challenge, but other challenges that end up featuring technology that this is one of the best I''ve seen. Clean, crisp, sharp, understated. Light on light - , yet no white outs,(I like the shadows)Heck I think it would make a great poster - It would look great in my computer room or family room.<br/>"It''s getting late pictures"? Well if it is I could only dream of doing such a fine job.</td>', 'Sorry you didn''t do better - you got jipped in my opinion. I gave it a 10. Found -not only for THIS challenge, but other challenges that end up featuring technology that this is one of the best I''ve seen. Clean, crisp, sharp, understated. Light on light - , yet no white outs,(I like the shadows)Heck I think it would make a great poster - It would look great in my computer room or family room."It''s getting late pictures"? Well if it is I could only dream of doing such a fine job.', '2004-11-09 06:44:25.000000', NULL, 0),
