(1004364, 116114, 22734, '<td valign="top">from the critique club:<br/> <br/>If I say just a slightly softer lighting would avoid the blow out at the terminal knobs we will move on to all that is positive and good about this image.<br/> <br/>  The overall look is commendable and the colors great for this type of subject. The image brings out the subject matter in good form and the blue, white, black and red compresses the color spectrum thereby simplying the intent of the image which is to show approbation for a very good product and its great hidden implication of the way the audio signal is converted into sound waves to entertain our ears and senses.Its final end is hearing the music.<br/> <br/>  The image has met the challenge and the score 5.5+ attest to its viability. To some this subject matter is not at all a factor because many place no importance on the art of music reproduction. However, those that do found more meaning in the image.<br/> <br/>To conclude: outside of the minor hot spots on the negative and positive terminals, the image has been very well presented and you were wise to incorporate the window reflection to add more interest. A very good effort.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-10 16:10:28.</i></td>', 'from the critique club: If I say just a slightly softer lighting would avoid the blow out at the terminal knobs we will move on to all that is positive and good about this image.   The overall look is commendable and the colors great for this type of subject. The image brings out the subject matter in good form and the blue, white, black and red compresses the color spectrum thereby simplying the intent of the image which is to show approbation for a very good product and its great hidden implication of the way the audio signal is converted into sound waves to entertain our ears and senses.Its final end is hearing the music.   The image has met the challenge and the score 5.5+ attest to its viability. To some this subject matter is not at all a factor because many place no importance on the art of music reproduction. However, those that do found more meaning in the image. To conclude: outside of the minor hot spots on the negative and positive terminals, the image has been very well presented and you were wise to incorporate the window reflection to add more interest. A very good effort.', '2004-11-10 15:46:40.000000', '2004-11-10 16:10:28.000000', 0),
(1006526, 116799, 24990, '<td valign="top">Greeting from the C.C.<br/>Joe Satriani, what a man!  Nearly as good as me...taught him everything I know....and...er....no wait...ah..I admit it, an S.G and a Les paul does not make me a rock god...<br/>Well, this shot is fantastically in focus, especially for a low light shot where the shutter has to stay open longer.  Nice angle, colours and satriation..heheh  a nice shot, nicely composed, I like it!  Maybe a different facial expression or a bit more action would have just made this shot different a even more exciting than it already is..that is all, but a great pic.</td>', 'Greeting from the C.C.Joe Satriani, what a man!  Nearly as good as me...taught him everything I know....and...er....no wait...ah..I admit it, an S.G and a Les paul does not make me a rock god...Well, this shot is fantastically in focus, especially for a low light shot where the shutter has to stay open longer.  Nice angle, colours and satriation..heheh  a nice shot, nicely composed, I like it!  Maybe a different facial expression or a bit more action would have just made this shot different a even more exciting than it already is..that is all, but a great pic.', '2004-11-11 16:59:19.000000', NULL, 0),
